<title>UK: Norfolk Trading sets $48.50 mln May 1998 bond.</title>
<headline>Norfolk Trading sets $48.50 mln May 1998 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Paribas Capital Markets and BBA-Creditanstalt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORFOLK TRADING</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  PETROQUIMICA UNIAO BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT    $45.80 MLN    COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    26.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO COUPON   ISS PRICE  87.7462   PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    87.7462   SPREAD	+375 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    40 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
